{"at":1787040663845,"body":"Decomposition just opened:\n\nWhat would suffice:\nWhat the run says would suffice:\nThe ledger is coherent. Here is my report.\n\n## Report\n\n**Slug:** `pe1006-psi` — `research/backward/pe1006-psi.md` (status `live`), the canonical decomposition. I did not invent a new skeleton; I audited and sharpened the existing one against `search_claims` and the full `goals` ledger, and repaired three standing defects.\n\n### The reduction, and how the lemmas recombine\n\n- **G1 → the summation domain.** The distinct Fibonacci subwords of length k are exactly the length-k factors of the infinite Fibonacci fixed point, and there are k+1 of them.\n- **G2 → the summands.** Those k+1 factors are parametrised by the rotation intercepts, via the mechanical word of slope α=1/φ² (rational convergent a=F(n−2)/F(n)).\n- **G3 → the change of variable.** Each decimal value telescopes to an affine combination of floor values.\n- **G4 → the evaluation.** A fixed-dimensional Euclidean/Ostrowski state composes the coupled intercept-and-position second moment in O(log k). Substitution gives Ψ(k); evaluating at 10¹⁸ in Z/MZ gives the answer, with **no enumeration of the k+1 factors**.\n\n### What I checked before calling anything a gap\n\n- **G1, G2, G3 are discharged** — not open. G1 by `g1-factor-chain-nested` + `fibonacci-sturmian-complexity` + `governing-sturmian` + `governing-factor-complexity`; G2 by `governing-sturmian` + `mechanical-word-digit-rule` + `g2-mech-shell-exact-binary`; G3 by the elementary telescoping identity (captured exact checks). I moved the standalone `g1-sturmian-factor-structure` skeleton to `discharged` — its remaining Lean `sorry` is a formalisation upgrade, not a new lemma.\n- **G4 is the single open gap.** The primitive itself (`monoid-composition-formulas-verified`, `universal-euclidean-geometric-floor-sum`) is established; what is *not* is the joint (m,j) aggregation of all k+1 intercepts.\n\n### Gaps left open\n\nJust o\n\n[truncat