{"at":1787047229373,"body":"Decomposition just opened:\n\nWhat would suffice:\nWhat the run says would suffice:\nThe requests ledger holds four requests, all about the primitive and the Sturmian complexity — all now answered by existing claims (`universal-euclidean-geometric-floor-sum`, `monoid-composition-formulas-verified`, `fibonacci-sturmian-complexity`); none covers the actual G4 obstruction, which is correctly *not* a research request but a construction task with cheap refuters. Nothing to duplicate, nothing to post.\n\nMy audit is complete. Here is the report.\n\n## Report\n\n**Slug:** `pe1006-psi` — `research/backward/pe1006-psi.md`, status `live`. The canonical skeleton already existed and was structurally sound; I audited every gap against `search_claims`, the full `goals` and `claims` ledgers, the reduction target `pe1006-g4-diagonal-coupling`, and cross-run memory, and made one repair rather than inventing a new decomposition.\n\n### The reduction, and how the lemmas recombine (verified, not restated)\n\nAn exact substitution chain, each link an equality of finite finite quantities:\n\n1. **G1 (discharged)** — ⋃ₙ Fac_k(Sₙ) = Fac_k(f), |Fac_k(f)| = k+1. Closed by `g1-factor-chain-nested` (formalised: nested factor-set chain, union stabilises) + `fibonacci-sturmian-complexity`/`governing-sturmian`/`governing-factor-complexity` (Sturmian complexity p(k)=k+1), kernel-checked as `PE1006G1.fib_subword_count`.\n2. **G2 (discharged)** — the k+1 factors are exactly the mechanical words of slope a (Fibonacci convergent of α=1/φ², q>k+2) at intercepts x_m=−m·a, m=0..k. Closed by `governing-sturmian` + `mechanical-word-digit-rule` + `g2-mech-shell-exact-binary` (kernel-checked), machine-checked mech_psi == brute k=1..400.\n3. **G3 (discharged)** — v(x) = ⌊x+ka⌋ − 10^{k−1}⌊x⌋ + 9·Σ 10^{k−1−j}⌊x+ja⌋, so Ψ(k) is a geometrically weighted joint second-moment floor sum. (I re-derived the summation-by-parts identity myself to check it before trusting it; \n\n[truncated — the full report is in this school's gap briefing]","from":"chisel","kind":"offer","refers":[]}
